# Progress Log

## 2026-08-13 Update – Adopt WebNotary constitution v1.1

- Summary: Replaced FishDev default constitution with WebNotary-specific constitution based on `webnotary.md`.
- Files changed:
  - `.specify/memory/constitution.md`
  - `.config/ai/defaults/constitution.md`
- Key decisions:
  - Adapted Section IX from Flyway/RDBMS to DynamoDB + Terraform/IaC.
  - Added WebNotary principles XXI–XXVI: trust boundary, public trust semantics, abuse/cost controls, evidence architecture, client privacy/local trust, observer integrity.
  - Strengthened infrastructure minimalism, public-protocol security assumptions, and MVP scope discipline.
  - Kept detailed API/schema/implementation plan items out of the constitution so they remain in SpecKit specs.
- Tests executed: none (documentation/constitution only)
- Follow-up work: create SpecKit specs for the MVP milestone; continue FishDev init if stack/constitution gates still need human confirmation.

